Breadboard Layout

Breadboard Top Rail: +5V
Breadboard Bottom Rail: GND

Left Side: LM1881
---------------------------------------
 LM1881 Pin 1 → +5V rail
 LM1881 Pin 8 → GND rail
 LM1881 Pin 2 → Composite Video In
 LM1881 Pin 3 → VSYNC → Nano D2
 LM1881 Pin 5 → GND
 LM1881 Pin 6/7 optional

Center: Arduino Nano
---------------------------------------
 Nano +5V → +5V rail
 Nano GND → GND rail

 Nano D2  ← VSYNC from LM1881
 Nano D9  → 1k → TV Composite In
 Nano D10 → 1k → TV Composite In (dual pulse)

Right Side: Buttons (mode 1)
---------------------------------------
 BTN_L0: one side → D3, other → GND
 BTN_L1: one side → D4, other → GND
 BTN_L2: one side → D5, other → GND
 BTN_L3: one side → D6, other → GND
 BTN_L4: one side → D7, other → GND
 BTN_L5: one side → D8, other → GND
 BTN_L6: one side → D11, other → GND

TV Composite Input
---------------------------------------
 TV IN → from 1k resistors (D9, D10)
 TV GND → GND rail

